# The main map's menu bar: the Menu and PullDown classes. The game lays the bar out above the top of
# its window (Menu_adjust puts it twice the font's height over the client area), so on a screen the
# size of the game's the pointer can only reach it at the top edge. The scene moves along that edge
# (the bar's titles, one after another), clicks on it, moves into the map and back, and snaps the map
# in between: the frames must not change. No keys: on the map they would play the turn. Leave time
# after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
25 load
42 snap map
46 move 40 0
48 move 120 0
50 move 200 3
52 click 120 0
56 snap bar-click
58 move 400 1
60 click 400 1
62 move 500 300
64 move 300 0
66 click 300 2
70 snap bar-again
72 move 500 300
74 click 640 640
78 snap closed
82 close
